Here's an older boy myth in scouting,

47
00:03:17,720 --> 00:03:20,220
And this is what the myth says:

48
00:03:20,220 --> 00:03:25,400
You can't get older boys to stay in scouting unless you give them a bunch of older boy

49
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:27,560
