51
00:03:31,799 --> 00:03:36,480
We're going to have a ferris wheel at the meeting place,

52
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:40,440
We're going to have a half pipe out at summer camp and everything like that.

53
00:03:40,440 --> 00:03:41,880
We have to distract them.

54
00:03:41,880 --> 00:03:48,600
We have to entertain them so that they'll want to stay with us and do exciting and

55
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:51,320
cool things.

56
00:03:51,320 --> 00:03:57,280
Now we age out- two or three boys out of a troop of 30 every year.

57
00:03:57,280 --> 00:04:03,960
So the older boy program in scouting is not about distracting them and keeping them entertained

58
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:06,640
with these kind of wild things.

59
00:04:06,640 --> 00:04:08,880
I'm all about high adventure.

60
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:09,960
I love it.

61
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,240
We go to Canada every year.

62
