We've been to Switzerland. absolutely.

63
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:16,160
I think high adventure is a great thing.

64
00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:24,760
But if you're trying to entertain your older boys and thus keep them involved, I think you're

65
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:26,440
barking up the wrong tree.

66
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:28,320
What's the older boy program in scouting?

67
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:32,480
Having the real responsibility to run their troop,

68
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:35,880
Having actual real leadership responsibility.

69
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:38,600
Without that, they do get bored and they do walk away.

70
00:04:38,600 --> 00:04:45,280
And they might be placated for a time with these kind of big activities and things like

71
00:04:45,280 --> 00:04:46,280
that,

72
00:04:46,280 --> 00:04:51,480
But if they don't have real, actual responsibility to run their own troop- you know, past the

73
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:55,200
age of 14,, 15, they're going to get bored and walk away.

